# 必考词 Unit04
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2025红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 必考词Unit04核心词汇

{{eager}}{{/ˈiːɡər}}{{adj. 渴望的；热切的}}{{She is eager to learn new things.}}
{{earnest}}{{/ˈɜːnɪst}}{{adj. 认真的；诚挚的}}{{He made an earnest effort to improve his grades.}}
{{eccentric}}{{/ɪkˈsentrɪk}}{{adj./n. 古怪的；怪人}}{{The professor is known for his eccentric behavior.}}
{{eclipse}}{{/ɪˈklɪps}}{{n./v. 日食；月食；使黯然失色}}{{Her achievement eclipsed all previous records.}}
{{ecology}}{{/iˈkɒlədʒi}}{{n. 生态学；生态}}{{The study of ecology is essential for understanding the environment.}}
{{economic}}{{/ˌiːkəˈnɒmɪk}}{{adj. 经济的；经济学的}}{{The country is experiencing an economic boom.}}
{{economy}}{{/iˈkɒnəmi}}{{n. 经济；节约；经济体}}{{The global economy is showing signs of recovery.}}
{{edit}}{{/ˈedɪt}}{{v. 编辑；校订；剪辑}}{{She edited the article before submission.}}
{{elaborate}}{{/ɪˈlæbərət}}{{adj./v. 精心制作的；详细阐述}}{{Could you elaborate on your proposal?}}
{{elapse}}{{/ɪˈlæps}}{{v. 时间流逝；过去}}{{Three hours elapsed before the meeting ended.}}
{{elect}}{{/ɪˈlekt}}{{v. 选举；选择}}{{The citizens elected a new president.}}
{{elegant}}{{/ˈelɪɡənt}}{{adj. 优雅的；精美的}}{{She wore an elegant dress to the dinner party.}}
{{element}}{{/ˈelɪmənt}}{{n. 元素；成分；要素}}{{Water is composed of two elements: hydrogen and oxygen.}}
{{elevate}}{{/ˈelɪveɪt}}{{v. 提升；举起；使高尚}}{{The new policy aims to elevate the quality of education.}}
{{eligible}}{{/ˈelɪdʒəbl}}{{adj. 有资格的；合格的}}{{Only citizens over 18 are eligible to vote.}}
{{eliminate}}{{/ɪˈlɪmɪneɪt}}{{v. 消除；淘汰}}{{We must eliminate all errors before publication.}}
{{elite}}{{/eɪˈliːt}}{{n./adj. 精英；精英的}}{{The university attracts elite students from around the world.}}
{{eloquent}}{{/ˈeləkwənt}}{{adj. 雄辩的；有口才的}}{{She is an eloquent speaker who captivates her audience.}}
{{embrace}}{{/ɪmˈbreɪs}}{{v./n. 拥抱；接受}}{{The company embraced new technology to improve productivity.}}
{{emerge}}{{/ɪˈmɜːdʒ}}{{v. 出现；浮现}}{{New evidence emerged during the investigation.}}
{{emergency}}{{/ɪˈmɜːdʒənsi}}{{n. 紧急情况；突发事件}}{{In case of emergency, call 120 immediately.}}
{{emit}}{{/ɪˈmɪt}}{{v. 发出；排放}}{{The factory emits large amounts of carbon dioxide.}}
{{emotion}}{{/ɪˈməʊʃn}}{{n. 情感；情绪}}{{She tried to hide her emotions during the meeting.}}
{{emphasis}}{{/ˈemfəsɪs}}{{n. 强调；重点}}{{The teacher placed emphasis on critical thinking.}}
{{empirical}}{{/ɪmˈpɪrɪkl}}{{adj. 经验主义的；以实验为根据的}}{{The theory is supported by empirical evidence.}}
{{enable}}{{/ɪˈneɪbl}}{{v. 使能够；使可能}}{{Technology enables us to communicate across the globe.}}
{{encounter}}{{/ɪnˈkaʊntər}}{{v./n. 遇到；遭遇}}{{We encountered many difficulties during the trip.}}
{{encourage}}{{/ɪnˈkʌrɪdʒ}}{{v. 鼓励；促进}}{{Teachers should encourage students to ask questions.}}
{{endow}}{{/ɪnˈdaʊ}}{{v. 赋予；捐赠；资助}}{{She is endowed with great musical talent.}}
{{endure}}{{/ɪnˈdjʊər}}{{v. 忍受；持续}}{{She endured years of hardship before achieving success.}}
{{enforce}}{{/ɪnˈfɔːs}}{{v. 执行；强制}}{{The police enforce the law to maintain order.}}
{{engage}}{{/ɪnˈɡeɪdʒ}}{{v. 从事；吸引；订婚}}{{She is engaged in scientific research.}}
{{enhance}}{{/ɪnˈhɑːns}}{{v. 提高；增强}}{{Exercise enhances both physical and mental health.}}
{{enormous}}{{/ɪˈnɔːməs}}{{adj. 巨大的；庞大的}}{{The project requires an enormous amount of investment.}}
{{enrich}}{{/ɪnˈrɪtʃ}}{{v. 充实；使富裕；使丰富}}{{Travel can enrich your life experience.}}
{{ensure}}{{/ɪnˈʃʊər}}{{v. 确保；保证}}{{Please ensure that all doors are locked before leaving.}}
{{enterprise}}{{/ˈentəpraɪz}}{{n. 企业；事业}}{{The enterprise has grown into a multinational corporation.}}
{{enthusiasm}}{{/ɪnˈθjuːziæzəm}}{{n. 热情；热心}}{{He showed great enthusiasm for the project.}}
{{entire}}{{/ɪnˈtaɪər}}{{adj. 整个的；全部的}}{{The entire family gathered for the holiday celebration.}}
{{entitle}}{{/ɪnˈtaɪtl}}{{v. 给予权利；给…命名}}{{This ticket entitles you to a free meal.}}
{{entity}}{{/ˈentəti}}{{n. 实体；存在}}{{The company is a separate legal entity.}}
{{environment}}{{/ɪnˈvaɪrənmənt}}{{n. 环境；自然环境}}{{Protecting the environment is everyone's responsibility.}}
{{epidemic}}{{/ˌepɪˈdemɪk}}{{n./adj. 流行病；流行性的}}{{The flu epidemic spread rapidly across the country.}}
{{episode}}{{/ˈepɪsəʊd}}{{n. 一集；插曲；事件}}{{The final episode of the series attracted millions of viewers.}}
{{epoch}}{{/ˈiːpɒk}}{{n. 时代；纪元；新纪元}}{{The invention of the internet marked a new epoch in communication.}}
{{equality}}{{/iˈkwɒləti}}{{n. 平等；相等}}{{The fight for gender equality continues worldwide.}}
{{equivalent}}{{/ɪˈkwɪvələnt}}{{adj./n. 等同的；等价物}}{{One mile is equivalent to 1.6 kilometers.}}
{{era}}{{/ˈɪərə}}{{n. 时代；纪元}}{{We are living in the era of digital transformation.}}
{{erode}}{{/ɪˈrəʊd}}{{v. 侵蚀；腐蚀；削弱}}{{The cliff has been eroded by the sea over centuries.}}
{{error}}{{/ˈerər}}{{n. 错误；过失}}{{There was an error in the calculation.}}
{{erupt}}{{/ɪˈrʌpt}}{{v. 爆发；喷出；突然发生}}{{The volcano erupted violently last year.}}
{{escape}}{{/ɪˈskeɪp}}{{v./n. 逃跑；逃避}}{{The prisoners attempted to escape from jail.}}
{{essence}}{{/ˈesns}}{{n. 本质；精华；精髓}}{{The essence of the argument is simple.}}
{{essential}}{{/ɪˈsenʃl}}{{adj. 必要的；本质的}}{{Water is essential for human survival.}}
{{establish}}{{/ɪˈstæblɪsh}}{{v. 建立；确立}}{{The university was established in 1905.}}
{{estate}}{{/ɪˈsteɪt}}{{n. 房地产；财产；庄园}}{{He invested in real estate and made a fortune.}}
{{estimate}}{{/ˈestɪmeɪt}}{{v./n. 估计；评价}}{{The cost is estimated at two million dollars.}}
{{ethical}}{{/ˈeθɪkl}}{{adj. 伦理的；道德的}}{{The company faces ethical questions about its practices.}}
{{evaluate}}{{/ɪˈvæljueɪt}}{{v. 评估；评价}}{{The committee will evaluate all the applications.}}
{{eventually}}{{/ɪˈventʃuəli}}{{adv. 最终；终于}}{{After years of hard work, she eventually achieved her goal.}}
{{evidence}}{{/ˈevɪdəns}}{{n. 证据；迹象}}{{There is strong evidence to support the theory.}}
{{evoke}}{{/ɪˈvəʊk}}{{v. 唤起；引起；使人想起}}{{The song evoked memories of her childhood.}}
{{evolution}}{{/ˌiːvəˈluːʃn}}{{n. 进化；发展}}{{The theory of evolution was proposed by Darwin.}}
{{evolve}}{{/ɪˈvɒlv}}{{v. 进化；发展}}{{Languages evolve over time.}}
{{exaggerate}}{{/ɪɡˈzædʒəreɪt}}{{v. 夸张；夸大}}{{He tends to exaggerate his achievements.}}
{{exceed}}{{/ɪkˈsiːd}}{{v. 超过；超越}}{{Sales exceeded expectations this quarter.}}
{{exceptional}}{{/ɪkˈsepʃənl}}{{adj. 异常的；杰出的；例外的}}{{She has exceptional talent in music.}}
{{excerpt}}{{/ˈeksɜːpt}}{{n./v. 摘录；节选}}{{The teacher read an excerpt from the novel.}}
{{excess}}{{/ɪkˈses}}{{n./adj. 过量；过量的}}{{An excess of sugar is bad for your teeth.}}
{{exclude}}{{/ɪkˈskluːd}}{{v. 排除；排斥}}{{The price excludes tax and delivery charges.}}
{{exclusive}}{{/ɪkˈskluːsɪv}}{{adj. 排他的；独家的；高级的}}{{The club is exclusive to members only.}}
{{execute}}{{/ˈeksɪkjuːt}}{{v. 执行；处决}}{{The plan was executed perfectly.}}
{{exemplify}}{{/ɪɡˈzemplɪfaɪ}}{{v. 举例说明；作为…的例证}}{{This case exemplifies the problem we are facing.}}
{{exempt}}{{/ɪɡˈzempt}}{{v./adj. 免除；被免除的}}{{Students with high grades are exempt from the final exam.}}
{{exert}}{{/ɪɡˈzɜːt}}{{v. 施加；运用；努力}}{{She exerted great influence on the decision.}}
{{exhaust}}{{/ɪɡˈzɔːst}}{{v./n. 使筋疲力尽；废气}}{{The long hike exhausted everyone.}}
{{exhibit}}{{/ɪɡˈzɪbɪt}}{{v./n. 展示；展览品}}{{The museum exhibits rare paintings from the 18th century.}}
{{expand}}{{/ɪkˈspænd}}{{v. 扩大；膨胀}}{{The company plans to expand into Asian markets.}}
{{explicit}}{{/ɪkˈsplɪsɪt}}{{adj. 明确的；清楚的}}{{The instructions must be explicit and easy to follow.}}
{{exploit}}{{/ɪkˈsplɔɪt}}{{v./n. 开发；利用；功绩}}{{We should exploit renewable energy resources.}}
{{explore}}{{/ɪkˈsplɔːr}}{{v. 探索；考察}}{{They explored the ancient ruins in the jungle.}}
{{expose}}{{/ɪkˈspəʊz}}{{v. 暴露；揭露}}{{The report exposed corruption in the government.}}
{{extensive}}{{/ɪkˈstensɪv}}{{adj. 广泛的；大量的}}{{The library has an extensive collection of books.}}
{{extent}}{{/ɪkˈstent}}{{n. 程度；范围}}{{To what extent do you agree with this statement?}}
{{external}}{{/ɪkˈstɜːnl}}{{adj. 外部的；外面的}}{{The external walls of the building need repainting.}}
{{extract}}{{/ɪkˈstrækt}}{{v./n. 提取；摘录；榨取}}{{They extracted oil from the ground.}}
{{extraordinary}}{{/ɪkˈstrɔːdnri}}{{adj. 非凡的；特别的}}{{She has extraordinary talent in music.}}
{{extreme}}{{/ɪkˈstriːm}}{{adj./n. 极端的；极度}}{{Extreme weather events are becoming more frequent.}}
{{fabricate}}{{/ˈfæbrɪkeɪt}}{{v. 捏造；制造；建造}}{{He fabricated evidence to support his claim.}}
{{facilitate}}{{/fəˈsɪlɪteɪt}}{{v. 促进；使便利}}{{Technology facilitates communication between people.}}
{{factor}}{{/ˈfæktər}}{{n. 因素；因子}}{{Several factors contributed to the success of the project.}}
{{fade}}{{/feɪd}}{{v. 褪色；消退；凋谢}}{{The color of the curtain has faded over the years.}}
{{faith}}{{/feɪθ}}{{n. 信念；信仰；信任}}{{She has great faith in her children's abilities.}}
{{famine}}{{/ˈfæmɪn}}{{n. 饥荒；严重的缺乏}}{{The famine killed millions of people.}}
{{fancy}}{{/ˈfænsi}}{{adj./v./n. 精致的；想象；爱好}}{{She has a fancy for collecting rare stamps.}}
{{fatal}}{{/ˈfeɪtl}}{{adj. 致命的；灾难性的}}{{The car accident was fatal to the driver.}}
{{feasible}}{{/ˈfiːzəbl}}{{adj. 可行的；可能的}}{{The plan is feasible within the given budget.}}
{{feature}}{{/ˈfiːtʃər}}{{n./v. 特征；以…为特色}}{{The phone has many new features.}}
{{federal}}{{/ˈfedərəl}}{{adj. 联邦的}}{{The federal government passed a new tax law.}}
{{feedback}}{{/ˈfiːdbæk}}{{n. 反馈；回馈}}{{We welcome feedback from our customers.}}
{{fierce}}{{/fɪəs}}{{adj. 猛烈的；凶猛的；激烈的}}{{The competition for the job is fierce.}}
{{finance}}{{/ˈfaɪnæns}}{{n./v. 财政；资助}}{{The government needs to improve its finance management.}}
{{finite}}{{/ˈfaɪnaɪt}}{{adj. 有限的；限定的}}{{The earth's resources are finite.}}
{{firm}}{{/fɜːm}}{{adj./n. 坚定的；公司}}{{She works for a law firm in the city center.}}
{{fiscal}}{{/ˈfɪskl}}{{adj. 财政的；国库的}}{{The government introduced new fiscal policies.}}
{{flaw}}{{/flɔː}}{{n. 缺点；裂纹；瑕疵}}{{The plan has a serious flaw.}}
{{flee}}{{/fliː}}{{v. 逃跑；逃避；消失}}{{The refugees fled their homeland to escape the war.}}
{{flexible}}{{/ˈfleksəbl}}{{adj. 灵活的；可变通的}}{{The company offers flexible working hours.}}
{{flourish}}{{/ˈflʌrɪʃ}}{{v. 繁荣；茂盛；挥舞}}{{The business has flourished under new management.}}
{{fluctuate}}{{/ˈflʌktʃueɪt}}{{v. 波动；涨落；动摇}}{{Stock prices fluctuate daily.}}
{{focus}}{{/ˈfəʊkəs}}{{v./n. 集中；焦点}}{{Please focus on the main points of the lecture.}}
{{forecast}}{{/ˈfɔːkɑːst}}{{v./n. 预测；预报}}{{The weather forecast predicts rain tomorrow.}}
{{forge}}{{/fɔːdʒ}}{{v. 锻造；伪造；建立}}{{The two countries forged a strong alliance.}}
{{formal}}{{/ˈfɔːml}}{{adj. 正式的；正规的}}{{The invitation requires formal attire.}}
{{format}}{{/ˈfɔːmæt}}{{n./v. 格式；格式化}}{{The report should be in PDF format.}}
{{formula}}{{/ˈfɔːmjələ}}{{n. 公式；方案；配方}}{{The mathematical formula is used to calculate the area.}}
{{formulate}}{{/ˈfɔːmjuleɪt}}{{v. 制定；明确表达；用公式表示}}{{The government formulated a new economic policy.}}
{{forthcoming}}{{/ˌfɔːθˈkʌmɪŋ}}{{adj. 即将来临的；乐于助人的； forthcoming}}{{The details of the plan will be available in the forthcoming report.}}
{{fossil}}{{/ˈfɒsl}}{{n. 化石}}{{Scientists discovered a rare fossil in the desert.}}
{{foster}}{{/ˈfɒstər}}{{v. 培养；促进；收养}}{{The program fosters creativity in young students.}}
{{foundation}}{{/faʊnˈdeɪʃn}}{{n. 基础；基金会}}{{Education is the foundation of a successful career.}}
{{fraction}}{{/ˈfrækʃn}}{{n. 分数；小部分；片段}}{{Only a fraction of the students passed the exam.}}
{{fragment}}{{/ˈfræɡmənt}}{{n. 碎片；片段；未完成部分}}{{Fragments of the broken vase were scattered on the floor.}}
{{framework}}{{/ˈfreɪmwɜːk}}{{n. 框架；结构；体系}}{{The government established a new legal framework.}}
{{frank}}{{/fræŋk}}{{adj. 坦率的；真诚的}}{{To be frank, I don't think the plan will work.}}
{{fraud}}{{/frɔːd}}{{n. 欺诈；骗子}}{{He was convicted of financial fraud.}}
{{frequent}}{{/ˈfriːkwənt}}{{adj. 频繁的；经常的}}{{Frequent exercise helps maintain good health.}}
{{friction}}{{/ˈfrɪkʃn}}{{n. 摩擦；冲突；不和}}{{There is some friction between the two departments.}}
{{frontier}}{{/ˈfrʌntɪər}}{{n. 边界；前沿；新领域}}{{Space is the final frontier for human exploration.}}
{{frustrate}}{{/frʌˈstreɪt}}{{v. 使沮丧；挫败；阻止}}{{The lack of progress frustrated the team.}}
{{fulfil/fulfill}}{{/fʊlˈfɪl}}{{v. 履行；实现；满足}}{{She fulfilled her dream of becoming a doctor.}}
{{function}}{{/ˈfʌŋkʃn}}{{n./v. 功能；运转；起作用}}{{The main function of the heart is to pump blood.}}
{{fund}}{{/fʌnd}}{{n./v. 基金；资助；为…提供资金}}{{The university received a large fund for research.}}
{{fundamental}}{{/ˌfʌndəˈmentl}}{{adj. 基本的；根本的}}{{Freedom of speech is a fundamental human right.}}
{{furnish}}{{/ˈfɜːnɪʃ}}{{v. 提供；布置家具；装备}}{{The apartment is fully furnished.}}
{{furthermore}}{{/ˌfɜːðəˈmɔːr}}{{adv. 此外；而且}}{{Furthermore, the study found no evidence of harm.}}
{{fusion}}{{/ˈfjuːʒn}}{{n. 融合；熔合；核聚变}}{{The restaurant offers a fusion of Asian and European cuisine.}}
